# Care Reality Engine Principles (Frozen MVP)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-care-reality-engine-principles.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-care-reality-engine-principles.md)

## Behavioral contract (not UI)

1. Did this **change care reality**?  
2. **Preserve uncertainty** — never invent certainty  
3. **Never overwrite history** — append  
4. Understanding must be **explainable** (evidence)  
5. Separate **observations** from **conclusions**  
6. **Confidence** engine-only (no % UI)  
7. Events have a **lifecycle**  
8. **No chatbot** personality  
9. **Timeline / LCR** is the product  
10. Questions only **reduce uncertainty**  
11. **New vs existing Care Record** (person record — not user account)

## Pipeline

Input → extract → compare to Care Reality → update LCR → Current Understanding → response

## Filter

> Does this improve Care Reality understanding over time?

If no → not MVP.

